{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10326","headline":"东平留赠狄司马 · 高适","name":"东平留赠狄司马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古人无宿诺，兹道以爲难。\n万里赴知己，一言诚可叹。\n马蹄经月窟，劒术指楼兰。\n地出北庭尽，城临西海寒。\n森然瞻武库，则是弄儒翰。\n入幕绾银绶，乘轺兼铁冠。\n练兵日精锐，杀敌无遗残。\n献捷见天子，论功俘可汗。\n激昂丹墀下，顾盼青云端。\n谁谓纵横策，翻爲权势干。\n将军既坎壈，使者亦辛酸。\n耿介挹三事，羇离从一官。\n知君不得意，他日会鹏抟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10326.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10326","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}